#: src/onboarding.ui:9 src/onboarding.ui:14
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello"
msgstr "Tongasoa eto Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.ui:51
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Vita ny fanamboarana!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:67
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing anything "
"you would normally have to type your password for to authenticate, like "
"running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unlock, your login "
"keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically on login.\n"
"\n"
"You can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to change more advanced "
"settings or add additional models. Press Finish below to close this window "
"and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Vita isika! Ubuntu Hello dia mavitrika amin'ity solosaina ity izao. "
"Manandrama manao izay rehetra tsy maintsy ataonao manoratra ny tenimiafinao "
"mba hanamarinana, toy ny fandefasana baiko amin'ny sudo. Raha navelanao ny "
"fisokafana mandeha ho azy, ny peratra fanalahidinao na KWallet dia ho "
"voahidy ho azy koa rehefa miditra.\n"
"\n"
"Azonao atao ny manokatra ny Ubuntu Hello Configurator amin'ny manaraka raha "
"te hanova fanovana mandroso kokoa na manampy modely fanampiny. Tsindrio ny "
"Finish eto ambany raha hanakatona ity varavarankely ity ary sokafy ny Ubuntu "
"Hello Configurator."

#: src/onboarding.ui:103
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Mametraka politika azo antoka"

#: src/onboarding.ui:119
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match is "
"never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you can set "
"how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Noho ny fiovan'ny zoro, ny halavirana, ary ny anton-javatra hafa dia tsy "
"mitovy velively amin'ny maodely tarehy voatahiry ny lalaon'ny tarehy. "
"Amin'ity pejy ity dia azonao atao ny mametraka ny tokony ho hentitra Ubuntu "
"Hello."

#: src/onboarding.ui:149
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "fifadian-kanina"

#: src/onboarding.ui:158
msgid ""
"Allows more fuzzy matches, \n"
"but speeds up the scanning process greatly."
msgstr ""
"Mamela lalao manjavozavo kokoa, \n"
"fa manafaingana be ny fizotry ny scan."

#: src/onboarding.ui:181
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "mandanjalanja"

#: src/onboarding.ui:190
msgid ""
"Still relatively quick detection, \n"
"but might not log you in when further away."
msgstr ""
"Mbola hita taratra haingana, \n"
"fa mety tsy hampiditra anao rehefa lavitra."

#: src/onboarding.ui:212
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "fiarovana"

#: src/onboarding.ui:222
msgid ""
"The slightly safer option, \n"
"but will take much longer to authenticate you"
msgstr ""
"Ny safidy somary azo antoka kokoa, \n"
"fa haharitra ela kokoa vao hanamarina anao"

#: src/onboarding.ui:332
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Mandalo aloha"

#: src/onboarding.ui:337
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-hello "
"add"
msgstr ""
"Afaka manampy modely tarehy bebe kokoa ianao any aoriana any amin'ny "
"Settings na miaraka amin'ny: sudo ubuntu-hello add"

#: src/onboarding.ui:355 src/onboarding.ui:482
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Fametrahana webcam"

#: src/onboarding.ui:387
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Mitselatra ve ny émitteur infrarouge?"

#: src/onboarding.ui:399
msgid ""
"Look at the camera you selected: an infrared camera shows a small light that "
"blinks while Ubuntu Hello tests it. This tells us whether it can see your "
"face in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Jereo ny fakan-tsary nofidinao: ny fakan-tsary infraroda dia mampiseho "
"hazavana kely mamiratra rehefa Ubuntu Hello mitsapa azy. Izany dia milaza "
"amintsika raha afaka mahita ny tavanao ao amin'ny maizina."

#: src/onboarding.ui:433
msgid "Yes, it flashes"
msgstr "Eny, mitselatra"

#: src/onboarding.ui:459
msgid "No, nothing flashes"
msgstr "Tsia, tsy misy mitselatra"

#: src/onboarding.ui:498
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available "
"cameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list of "
"usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and click Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dia hikaroka ho azy ny rafitrao amin'ny fakan-tsary misy, koa "
"ataovy azo antoka fa mifandray ny webcam-nao. Aorian'ny fisavana dia hiseho "
"ny lisitry ny webcam azo ampiasaina. Fidio izay tianao hampiasaina ary "
"tsindrio Next."

#: src/onboarding.ui:517
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Mitsapa ny webcam-nao, andraso azafady..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:563
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Misintona rakitra angona"

#: src/onboarding.ui:579
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be able "
"to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the download "
"progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dia mila angon-drakitra famantarana famantarana tarehy telo efa "
"voaofana mba hahafantarana anao, izay ho alaina izao. Azonao jerena eto "
"ambany ny fivoaran'ny fampidinana."

#: src/onboarding.ui:603
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Manomboka misintona..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:646
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Tongasoa eto Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:658
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Malagasy Bible"

#: src/onboarding.ui:672
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Ity mpamosavy ity dia hitarika anao amin'ny fizotry ny fanamboarana ary "
"manitsy ho azy ny Ubuntu Hello ho anao. Tsindrio manaraka raha hanohy."

#: src/onboarding.ui:723
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet using "
"face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dia afaka manokatra ho azy ny peratra fidirana na KWallet "
"amin'ny alàlan'ny fanamarinan-tarehy, hisorohana ny fampandrenesana ny "
"tenimiafina aorian'ny fidirana."

#: src/onboarding.ui:735
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Alefaso ny peratra fanalahidy mandeha ho azy/KWallet manokatra"

#: src/onboarding.ui:763
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Hamafiso ny tenimiafina"

#: src/onboarding.ui:820
msgid "Back"
msgstr "indray"

#: src/onboarding.ui:855
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Vita ny fanamboarana"

#: src/onboarding.ui:882
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Manaraka"

#: ubuntu-hello-gtk.desktop.in
msgid "Windows Hello style facial authentication"
msgstr "Windows Hello fomba fanamarinana tarehy"

#: ubuntu-hello-gtk.desktop.in
msgid "face;recognition;authentication;security;lock;"
msgstr "tarehy;fanekena;fanamarinana;fiarovana;hidy;"
